#
# /metadata before post-fs (docs §65.6). init.rc creates vold, password_slots,
# apex and staged-install there, and aconfigd sets up its flag storage, all at
# post-fs: mounted at late-fs like /data, nobody saw it. mount_all --early
# only mounts the fstab entries without latemount, i.e. /metadata: /data stays
# at late-fs (encryption, §37), misc is emmc, zram is swap, USB voldmanaged.
on fs
    mount_all --early
